    "%@ 个自动备份校验失败，已从一键恢复列表中隐藏；请检查备份目录或重新创建备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ automatic backups failed validation and were hidden from Quick Restore. Check the backup folder or create new backups."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 个自动备份校验失败，已从一键恢复列表中隐藏；请检查备份目录或重新创建备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
