    "GitHub Pages 首次部署通常需要到仓库 Settings > Pages 确认来源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the first GitHub Pages deployment, you usually need to confirm the source under Settings > Pages in the repository."
