    "“%@”刷新失败，正在显示 %@ / %@ 篇本机文章。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” failed to refresh. Showing %@ of %@ articles stored on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@”刷新失败，正在显示 %2$@ / %3$@ 篇本机文章。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”刷新失败，正在显示 %lld / %lld 篇本机文章。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” failed to refresh. Showing %lld of %lld articles stored on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”刷新失败，正在显示 %lld / %lld 篇本机文章。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”及其中的消息将从本机删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” and its messages will be deleted from this Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”及其中的消息将从本机删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”将作用于文章“%@”。软件只执行这一项，不会自动确认后续步骤。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"%@\" will act on article \"%@\". The app runs only this action and does not automatically confirm later steps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”将作用于文章“%@”。软件只执行这一项，不会自动确认后续步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”将发布当前站点中所有通过检查的待发布变更。软件只执行这一项，不会自动确认后续步骤。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"%@\" will publish every reviewed pending change in the current site. The app runs only this action and does not automatically confirm later steps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”将发布当前站点中所有通过检查的待发布变更。软件只执行这一项，不会自动确认后续步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”读取失败": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t Load “%@”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”读取失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“未登记”只表示已载入文章的附件列表中没有该图片；主题、CSS 或其他文件仍可能引用它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Unregistered\" only means the image does not appear in the attachment lists of loaded articles. Themes, CSS, or other files may still reference it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“未登记”只表示已载入文章的附件列表中没有该图片；主题、CSS 或其他文件仍可能引用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“未知”表示应用可以尝试请求，但实际能力取决于接口或所选模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Unknown\" means the app can attempt the request, but actual support depends on the endpoint or selected model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“未知”表示应用可以尝试请求，但实际能力取决于接口或所选模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
