    "先克隆主题仓库，再回到这里选择“导入已有站点”。导入会保留主题文件，不会把主题改造成 Starter。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clone the theme repository first, then return here and choose “Import Existing Site.” The import keeps the theme files intact and does not convert the theme into a starter."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先克隆主题仓库，再回到这里选择“导入已有站点”。导入会保留主题文件，不会把主题改造成 Starter。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先写本地 Markdown 草稿，不要求仓库、站点类型或发布配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with local Markdown drafts without configuring a repository, site type, or publishing settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先写本地 Markdown 草稿，不要求仓库、站点类型或发布配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先分析内容，再确认导入。原始文件、图片与仓库都不会在预览阶段被改写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analyze the content before confirming the import. Source files, images, and the repository are not modified during preview."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先分析内容，再确认导入。原始文件、图片与仓库都不会在预览阶段被改写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先处理文章检查结果，再写入或线上发布。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resolve the article checks before writing files or publishing online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先处理文章检查结果，再写入或线上发布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先处理网站更新，再审阅这台 Mac 上的变化，确认后进入统一发布流程。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review website updates first, then changes on this Mac, and continue to the unified publishing flow."
          }
