            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除后不会影响已经插入文章的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除后，%@ 的仓库创建、权限检查、线上发布与回滚将不可用，直到重新保存令牌。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After deletion, repository creation, permission checks, publishing, and rollback for %@ will be unavailable until the token is saved again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除后，%@ 的仓库创建、权限检查、线上发布与回滚将不可用，直到重新保存令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除后，使用当前服务的 AI 写作、对话和批量建议将不可用，直到重新保存 Key。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After deletion, AI writing, chat, and batch suggestions for the current service will be unavailable until the key is saved again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除后，使用当前服务的 AI 写作、对话和批量建议将不可用，直到重新保存 Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除后，发布抽屉将无法读取该统计服务的数据，直到重新保存令牌。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After deletion, the publish drawer cannot read data from this analytics service until you save the token again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除后，发布抽屉将无法读取该统计服务的数据，直到重新保存令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
