    "应用会先校验所有文件和数据库，再显示恢复内容预览；此步骤不会修改当前资料库。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app validates every file and the database before showing a restore preview; this step does not modify the current knowledge library."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用会先校验所有文件和数据库，再显示恢复内容预览；此步骤不会修改当前资料库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用会先校验清单、快照、资料库、RSS 和附件；此步骤不会修改当前工作区。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app first validates the manifest, snapshot, library, RSS, and attachments; this step does not modify the current workspace."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用会先校验清单、快照、资料库、RSS 和附件；此步骤不会修改当前工作区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用会创建独立恢复文件夹，并复制主文件和上次有效备份；原文件不会改变。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app will create a separate recovery folder and copy the primary file and last-known-good backup without changing the originals."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用会创建独立恢复文件夹，并复制主文件和上次有效备份；原文件不会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用会在此目录创建每日或每周工作区备份，并在创建后自动校验。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app will create daily or weekly workspace backups in this folder and validate each backup after creation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用会在此目录创建每日或每周工作区备份，并在创建后自动校验。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
