    "损坏账本会先保留为备份，然后创建空账本。已有资料不会被删除，但旧操作回执将不再用于去重。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The corrupted ledger will be preserved as a backup before an empty ledger is created. Existing data will not be deleted, but old operation receipts will no longer be used for deduplication."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "损坏账本会先保留为备份，然后创建空账本。已有资料不会被删除，但旧操作回执将不再用于去重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
