    "资料库、RSS 刷新或备份仍在运行，请完成后再更改存储位置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A library task, RSS refresh, or backup is still running. Change the storage location after it finishes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
