            "value": "资料库、RSS 刷新或备份仍在运行，请完成后再更改存储位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资料库、RSS、工作台和应用内附件会统一保存在这个文件夹。删除并重新安装应用后，再次选择它即可恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The library, RSS data, workspace, and managed attachments are stored together in this folder. After deleting and reinstalling the app, select it again to restore your data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "资料库、RSS、工作台和应用内附件会统一保存在这个文件夹。删除并重新安装应用后，再次选择它即可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资料库中的“允许发送给远程 AI”是独立的逐条权限，默认关闭；只有资料权限和本处授权同时满足时，资料片段才会发送。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The “Allow Sending to Remote AI” permission in the knowledge library is set independently for each item and is off by default. Knowledge excerpts are sent only when both the item permission and this authorization are enabled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "资料库中的“允许发送给远程 AI”是独立的逐条权限，默认关闭；只有资料权限和本处授权同时满足时，资料片段才会发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
